B.Vj=new A.c5("smarden-network","smarden-network","Smarden Network","B2B2C Electrical Products & Partner Network","A B2B2C electrical-products distribution platform connecting electricians, distributors, architects, and customers through requirements, quotations, orders, payments, and commission workflows.\n\nSmarden Network streamlines complex electrical supply-chain relationships into a structured digital ecosystem. Built with GetX reactive architecture, the platform accommodates distinct presentation shells for client transactions, partner management, and native administrative verification.","B2B & Distribution",B.bM,B.Qm,"B2B Platform",B.Q_,B.Qc,B.NC,B.a_,B.US,B.UX,"The electrical distribution and contractor ecosystem in India operates largely through unorganized offline channels: handwritten requirement slips, verbal price quotations, unverified manual payment receipts, and disputed commission tracking. Electricians, architects, and distributors face immense friction in quoting accurate prices, managing order fulfillment, and verifying payment transactions transparently.",null,null,"2024 - Present",null,3,"Flutter Developer",B.dn,!1,"https://smarden.in/","https://smarden.in/privacy-policy/",u.u,null,null,B.Qy,B.bK)
