B.Vd=new A.c5("smarden","smarden","SmarDen Platform","IoT, Automation & B2B Ecosystem","An ecosystem of Flutter applications spanning smart-building automation, real-time IoT control, and B2B electrical-product distribution \u2014 built around reusable technology and white-label deployment.\n\nSmarDen is not a single isolated mobile application. It is an enterprise multi-product technology ecosystem consisting of two core production Flutter applications: SmarDen Prime (Smart Building & IoT Automation) and Smarden Network (B2B2C Electrical Products & Partner Network).\n\nBoth platforms leverage shared architectural foundations in Flutter and Dart, connecting distributed hardware devices, local protocols, real-time cloud brokers, and complex B2B commerce workflows while powering multiple branded OEM deployments.","IoT & Platform",B.V8,B.PF,"IoT / Home Automation / B2B Platform",B.MI,B.Pc,B.Qa,B.PZ,B.UW,null,null,"The same core technology is adapted and deployed as branded applications for different OEM and enterprise partners. Instead of rebuilding the entire application for each partner, a centralized foundation combines:\n\n\u2022 Reusable Core Engine: Shared communication, device discovery, state management, and real-time synchronization.\n\u2022 Tenant & Organization Configuration: Dynamic runtime branding that adapts display name, logo assets, primary/seed color palettes, and operational modules per organization.\n\u2022 Multi-Protocol Hardware Layer: Universal device abstractions compatible across diverse branded hardware catalogs.\n\u2022 Branded Applications: Seamless OEM deployments that maintain dedicated customer-facing brand identities while guaranteeing rock-solid production stability.",null,"2023 - Present",null,4,"Core Flutter Engineer",B.dn,!0,"https://smarden.in/","https://smarden.in/privacy-policy/",u.u,null,null,B.Or,B.OR)
